OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1785950321
OL,3,CFive arrested as armed police called
OL,4,Cto car wash
OL,6,FFive people have been arrested
OL,7,Ffollowing reports of "an affray
OL,8,Finvolving weapons" at a car wash in
OL,9,FTaff's Well.
OL,11,FPolice were called to the address on
OL,12,FCardiff Road at around 11:50am on
OL,13,FSunday (2nd August).
OL,15,FThe five were arrested on suspicion of
OL,16,Faffray and enquiries are continuing,
OL,17,FSouth Wales Police have confirmed.
OL,19,FSpecialist firearms officers were also
OL,20,Fin attendance.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/2
