OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1785950321
OL,3,CFive arrested as armed police called
OL,4,Cto car wash
OL,6,FIn a statement, the force said, "There
OL,7,Fis no wider risk to the public at this
OL,8,Ftime.
OL,10,F"We understand incidents of this
OL,11,Fnature can cause concern in the local
OL,12,Fcommunity, and we would like to
OL,13,Freassure residents that those involved
OL,14,Fhave been arrested and enquiries are
OL,15,Fongoing to establish the full
OL,16,Fcircumstances."
